  "version": "1.0.0-alpha.4",
  "notes": "## 1.0.0-alpha.4 - 2026-08-15\n\n### Features\n\n- Review changes to a device group and choose which devices to keep syncing with when a decision is needed (#1552)\n- Control all syncing separately from automatic clipboard syncing, so manual sends remain available when automatic syncing is off (#1546)\n- Make device invitations the primary add-device action and move the deprecated phone-over-LAN option under Other ways to add (#1532)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Complete invitation screens reliably after the new device finishes pairing, including after a connection interruption (#1555)\n- Show a clear unavailable message when text preview content cannot be loaded (#1556)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.0.0-alpha.4 - 2026-08-15\n\n### Features\n\n- 当设备组发生需要确认的变更时，可查看详情并选择要继续同步的设备 (#1552)\n- 可分别控制全部同步和剪贴板自动同步，关闭自动同步后仍可手动发送内容 (#1546)\n- 将邀请设备设为主要添加入口，并把即将弃用的手机局域网连接移至“其他添加方式” (#1532)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 新设备完成配对后，邀请界面现在能可靠显示完成状态，包括连接曾中断的情况 (#1555)\n- 文本预览内容无法加载时显示明确的不可用提示 (#1556)",
